# Fixture bytes are part of the measurement: a task fixture that checks out with
# different line endings on a different host is a different fixture, and
# `dataset_version` would not record the change. The repo root already pins
# .md/.py/.json/.toml to LF; these are the extensions this bank adds.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
